SECTION 13 — REMOTE NETWORK INTERACTION COMPLIANCE:
If you modify this Program and make it accessible to users remotely over
a computer network (for example, via Google Cloud Run or self-hosted Docker),
your modified version must prominently offer all users interacting with it
remotely an opportunity to receive the Corresponding Source of your version
by providing access to the Corresponding Source from a network server at no
charge, through a standard or customary means of facilitating copying of
software.
